1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,023
Day 4 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,607
81 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,607 --> 00:00:07,258
…and 62 of them
are from Mats!

4
00:00:07,258 --> 00:00:10,025
He calls himself
"the town comment spammer"!

5
00:00:10,025 --> 00:00:12,462
He wants a comment
spam contest…

6
00:00:12,462 --> 00:00:14,022
…but he already won!

7
00:00:14,022 --> 00:00:17,556
Still, that's
€124 for the town!

8
00:00:17,896 --> 00:00:20,442
Yesterday: 89 residents.

9
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:22,375
Today, we are 98!

10
00:00:22,715 --> 00:00:26,899
That brings
€9,176 into the budget!

11
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:30,076
UserFromRO gets
a house with an M5!

12
00:00:30,416 --> 00:00:32,127
Salih gets
a villa!

13
00:00:32,716 --> 00:00:34,973
Sanulatesade gets
a house!

14
00:00:35,313 --> 00:00:38,762
cnaaitsirh, Iain and Bob:
your homes come next!

15
00:00:39,102 --> 00:00:42,275
Thomas wanted
a fence and a basketball court…

16
00:00:42,275 --> 00:00:42,999
Done!

17
00:00:43,339 --> 00:00:47,509
Kalilay, Camille and 5 more
move into the apartment block!

18
00:00:47,509 --> 00:00:49,766
Welcome Ayalneh and Lerato!

19
00:00:50,106 --> 00:00:52,188
doodle
wants to be president too!

20
00:00:52,188 --> 00:00:54,689
The election has
5 candidates now!

21
00:00:54,689 --> 00:00:57,561
Divish and Alex
have 1 vote each!

22
00:00:57,561 --> 00:00:59,469
Reply with a name
to vote!

23
00:00:59,809 --> 00:01:01,485
"D bucks", doodle?

24
00:01:01,485 --> 00:01:04,148
Sorry, Leoville pays
in euros!

25
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:06,745
A revolution, Barhoum?

26
00:01:06,745 --> 00:01:08,607
Leoville has no king…
yet!

27
00:01:08,947 --> 00:01:11,157
Mats is lonely
in the robot house…

28
00:01:11,157 --> 00:01:13,256
Who wants to
move in with Mats?

29
00:01:13,596 --> 00:01:15,138
And what do you
want next?

30
00:01:15,138 --> 00:01:17,894
Military Base and school
are tied!

31
00:01:18,234 --> 00:01:21,534
The school costs
€120,000.

32
00:01:21,534 --> 00:01:23,848
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

33
00:01:23,848 --> 00:01:26,326
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

34
00:01:26,666 --> 00:01:28,326
Who should lead
Leoville?

35
00:01:28,326 --> 00:01:30,107
Vote in the
comments!
